  "title": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Announces Expansion Plans at Midland, Pennsylvania Facilities",
  "summary": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. (NASDAQ: MIGI) (\"Mawson\"), a digital infrastructure company, today announced plans for expansion of the Company's Midland, Pennsylvania digital infrastructure and bitcoin digital mining facilities to 120 MW and is expected to increase total miner capacity at that operational site to about 38,810 miners.",
